{"type":"message","id":"a8f70ae6","parentId":"b648f661","timestamp":"2026-03-14T22:40:10.859Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0257c04c2d73fea50169b5e3cb41588191afa33bf3ae5964e8\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABptePLtJZE0aZJNue0uRwxmaCUeyf_78K4Dwq7SQePI6SEwgk3Ye3hczt5lSb9cngKvy1zpKprbaKOlcBhbag_0vRqYbfK4h1i9s2txhDgiF6xPu6opB7BuoyuVt2ZKNRAsOzPny2djvd5LvBZO-3ylXhVHg84lvMzvZhaPB3kA-GPfWXAVpbbDIMNVQfBikBFUs8LYUTho9kjsNXI3Wrewk0j8LcwYY0tnx5fJ3h2cfx2u8yVptuaoEiqtJyadUMpFvIdlMPpARh7zXt2-1RWP-FbmusY7nS9nqXKjUv9OrybuBODqTjYKBotINJ6z3lNZB9vLttuLZlFhqn2mYlZOxo1EnSAsiKm3lJB-JAcuIeLfhnt7sfqf4QWVlVoL_X-pfmpECts0wBQwMnolH_5ita4wkJYumt05SKlBUhgZcVQlr-fO09QBklS7S5CNMUb6duEtEt7gYQT6t9282z6UtKVzoX63yCQhnMT25InbVSGJW9LHQoP_YHwU6A_XQfFSntvEDdkTv-wfhHSBvhi_U48KojaIzCe-4jhIa7Ww_olzZ7bVoz_ZPkKxoIAdIrT3uxRFdO0vlJPJR-JBlpuQMZP41Cder3pxFoY9sxg33T5HHlYH1iPx_LZs6gPPikoWle-cx3GkvqDdOzxMFXPkCfyO6rM35l7LRsXTvCWGTJJlFvEuwUmKJ_9-pEYYHf9AtrK0h-VbZ1nC5XG4sB7s1HJ4Ro1SZkIyrG7GxZ-8zRa7OXr2QwwhmKSVu9tXK6c7jcu5QbCzLsfvOsZNpcjWK859HjCwvYdFdYUlVjlh5D34cQhVSrh8Wx_G0LGQka0n5-zvH7pkZ02dtRnWfMywLVKwtLnvapBmbDu5FUYU-kZKYdMn9Uu0QhPEc59VaWHPrwoVV3YDcBBfVEiPthjJgBGfw==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"게이트웨이 재시작 후 deep probe를 바로 재검증하겠습니다.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0257c04c2d73fea50169b5e3cbf05c8191b1d6011dcbee2c74\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_L1iidu42ubokGAUMizMyw82v|fc_0257c04c2d73fea50169b5e3cc339081918c8964fed6a9f07c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw gateway restart && echo '---RECHECK---' && openclaw status --deep && echo '---AUDIT---' && openclaw security audit --deep","workdir":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":240},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"openclaw gateway restart && echo '---RECHECK---' && openclaw status --deep && echo '---AUDIT---' && openclaw security audit --deep\",\"workdir\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace