hat I need. I just want to ensure I'm selecting the best approach to gather the necessary information efficiently. Let’s see how everything lines up once I start working with the tools available!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"리포 구조와 README를 읽어서, 실제로 “쓸 만한 스킬인지” 관점으로 검토하겠습니다.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0257c04c2d73fea50169b6b79a006881919b105aeaecf8fce0\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aQJrB51vxZdkpijCXEXthrnr|fc_0257c04c2d73fea50169b6b79c69e08191a197b5c0ca0d87cd","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://github.com/corazzon/pptx-design-styles","extractMode":"markdown","maxChars":12000},"partialJson":"{\"url\":\"https://github.com/corazzon/pptx-design-styles\",\"extractMode\":\"markdown\",\"maxChars\":12000}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_9zRyHE5uQWtr1oVSKR4UIwgK|fc_0257c04c2d73fea50169b6b79c69f081919277bbe5d0cd1f96","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh repo view corazzon/pptx-design-styles --json name,description,url,homepageUrl,defaultBranchRef,stargazerCount,forkCount,createdAt,updatedAt,licenseInfo,owner","workdir":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"gh repo view corazzon/pptx-design-styles --json name,description,url,homepageUrl,defaultBranchRef,stargazerCount,forkCount,createdAt,updatedAt,licenseInfo,owner\",\"workdir\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_zVnK4DEQpYv0xf5V4mLsOkg0|fc_0257c04c2d73fea50169b6b79c69f481918fa8f5f3f5a2eb41","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh api repos/corazzon/pptx-design-styles/contents --jq '.[].name'","workdir":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"gh api repos/corazzon/pptx-design-styles/contents --jq '.[].name'\",\"workdir\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":462,"output"